352 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 259 0 R
/E (To our invited guests and cooperating institutions, thank you for joining us. I also thank my fellow Board Members, Management and Staff for their service, and our members for their continued support.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 259 0 R
/E (I trust that our deliberations will be productive and that we will leave with a clearer understanding of the work ahead.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
354 0 obj
<<
