/P 266 0 R
/E (The meeting was called to order at 10:00 hours by the General Manager of the Zambia Music Copyright Protection Society \(ZAMCOPS\), Mr. Mirrias Siamutondo. Mr. Siamutondo welcomed all members and invited guests and expressed appreciation for their attendance.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
550 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 266 0 R
/E (Thereafter, attendees were asked to stand for the singing of the National Anthem, which was followed by an opening prayer by Mr. Matteyo, after which the agenda of the meeting was presented.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
551 0 obj
<<
