/Pg 22 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
674 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 269 0 R
/E (Response: ZAMCOPS explained that royalty calculations are based on the number of airplays per artist, per song, for each given radio or television station. Every licensed station is required to provide a playlist, also known as a log sheet. Members were alerted to the fact that only registered and updated songs qualify for distribution.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [14]
>>
